error E0050: no visible function has this dot-call name  temperature.mo:37:39

  37 |   number = trimmed.chars.take(trimmed.length - 1)
     |                                       ^^^^^^ not visible in this block

The library has no len or length: a list's length is list.size, and a text's is text.char_count or text.byte_count (reference 3.4).

