The arms must cover every possible value (reference 7.2).

error E0075: arithmetic is used on a type without Number  temperature.mo:72:3

  72 |   reading.degrees.to_text() + symbol(reading.scale) + " = " + converted.degrees.to_text() + symbol(other)
     |   ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ expected Int or BigInt or Decimal or Float, found Text

Text has no Number, so + doesn't join texts; insert them into one text instead, as in "#{a}#{b}" (reference 3.4).

error E0051: a visible name is bound again  temperature.mo:82:9

  82 |         status = 1
     |         ^^^^^^ this name already has a meaning

  --> temperature.mo:76:3
  76 |   status = 0
     |   ^^^^^^ the other meaning of this name

While a name is visible it can't be bound again; to assign it again, declare it with var where it is first bound (reference 6.2).

Fix: declare it with var
  temperature.mo:76:3
  76 |   var status = 0

